8c4b814331dff96f11cea17c687d27","anonymous_pull":true,"attached":["https://cyclonedx.org/bom","https://sigstore.dev/cosign/sign/v1","https://slsa.dev/provenance/v1"]}},{"id":"oidc","layer":"cloud","title":"CI role trust policy pinned to one repository and one branch","threat":{"text":"The CI role's trust policy is the one place where a small edit (`StringEquals` to `StringLike`, or a `*` in the `sub` value) would let any workflow in the repository, including pull request runs, assume the role.","src":"docs/DEPLOYMENT.md","line":197},"limits":[{"text":"The CI role's trust policy is pinned by a `terraform test` (see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md), but `main` has no branch protection, so whoever can push to `main` controls what may assume that role. The role has no consumer today.","src":"docs/THREAT_MODEL.md","line":91},{"text":"It checks the policy as written in Terraform, not what AWS stores after an apply, and it does not cover branch protection on `main`: anyone who can push to `main` still controls what runs with that `sub`. Branch protection is not configured for this repository.","src":"docs/DEPLOYMENT.md","line":212}],"code":[{"path":"infra/terraform/modules/kevgate/iam.tf","start":14,"end":41},{"path":"infra/terraform/modules/kevgate/variables.tf","start":23,"end":32},{"path":"infra/terraform/modules/kevgate/tests/oidc_trust.tftest.hcl","start":40,"end":100}],"tests":[],"ci":[{"wf":"terraform","job":"OIDC trust policy regression (terraform test)","job_id":130313282767,"step":"Trust policy must be StringEquals on aud and one exact sub, no wildcard","n":4,"conclusion":"success","src":{"path":".github/workflows/terraform.yml","start":81,"end":86},"asserts":[{"path":"infra/terraform/modules/kevgate/tests/oidc_trust.tftest.hcl","start":120,"end":129}]}]}]}
